            "detailed_description": "<strong>Grab your friends and throw'em to the sacrifice pit before they throw you!</strong><br><br>Tiki Brawl is a fast-paced local multiplayer game where players must grab their opponents and throw them into a sacrifice pit to survive and win.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Local multiplayer, up to 5 players (4 xinput compatible gamepads + 1 keyboard).<br></li><li> Add bots to your matches to make it more challenging!<br></li><li> Just one level, but includes lots of randomness with its items: power-ups, weapons, punishments, etc... Try them all!<br></li><li> 8-bit sound FX and a catchy Tiki tribal song. (♫ Feed your god, your god is hungry ♫)<br></li><li> Highly recommended for parties, with friends, pizza and snacks!</li></ul>",
